{"4258930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Modified Girl Eurie!", "steam_appid": 4258930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based RPG where you fight as Modified Girl Eurie. Defeat monsters and save the residents of Tengetsu Town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Primordial Monster has fallen. No new monsters can be born. But that doesn't mean the monsters aren't still spreading chaos in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eurie, a new Modified Girl, is dispatched to the crime-ridden Tengetsu Town on her first solo mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special androids have been brought into the town to maintain public order. Because of that, the residents seem to think Eurie is a new model of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Eurie convince the residents and fulfill her mission?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or does failure await her at the end?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle &amp; boss defeat scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemies and varied situations to navigate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x speed mechanic to allow you to play at your own tempo and skip annoying fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to fast travel to map locations once certain events are cleared</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recollection room to replay fight and defeat scenes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258930/extras/4e898e3cb1697cdf0477d2464d30940f.avif?t=1782998247\" width=282 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eurie</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice: Ame Otome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheltered daughter of a rich family. Cheerful and naive, she doesn't recognize malice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She decides to become a Modified Girl after being injured by monsters, as she looks up to Makina, the main character of the previous game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based RPG where you fight as Modified Girl Eurie. Defeat monsters and save the residents of Tengetsu Town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Primordial Monster has fallen. No new monsters can be born. But that doesn't mean the monsters aren't still spreading chaos in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eurie, a new Modified Girl, is dispatched to the crime-ridden Tengetsu Town on her first solo mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special androids have been brought into the town to maintain public order. Because of that, the residents seem to think Eurie is a new model of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Eurie convince the residents and fulfill her mission?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or does failure await her at the end?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle &amp; boss defeat scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemies and varied situations to navigate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x speed mechanic to allow you to play at your own tempo and skip annoying fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to fast travel to map locations once certain events are cleared</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recollection room to replay fight and defeat scenes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258930/extras/4e898e3cb1697cdf0477d2464d30940f.avif?t=1782998247\" width=282 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eurie</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice: Ame Otome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheltered daughter of a rich family. Cheerful and naive, she doesn't recognize malice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She decides to become a Modified Girl after being injured by monsters, as she looks up to Makina, the main character of the previous game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Modified Girl Eurie is dispatched to Tengetsu Town. Her mission is to rescue those who are powerless to fight and wipe out the monsters near the town.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258930/e71048c946772fe4540ddbd0c575104454b84c60/header.jpg?t=1782998247", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258930/d681decad733a55956d628d096cf7d1cc2a92adb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782998247", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258930/d681decad733a55956d628d096cf7d1cc2a92adb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782998247", "website": "https://shiravune.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core 2 Duo or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"